AltoCappedChainlinkOracle::updateChainlinkNode()
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── when _chainlinkNode is valid
│       └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when _chainlinkNode is invalid
    │   ├── when node feed is zero address
    │   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
    │   ├── when node stalePeriod is zero
    │   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
    │   ├── when node inDecimals + outDecimals is greater than 54
    │   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
    │   └── when node feedDecimals does not match feed decimals
    │       └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
    └── when _chainlinkNode is valid
        ├── it should emit SetChainlinkNode with old and new nodes
        ├── it should replace the existing chainlinkNode
        └── it should update chainlinkNode correctly
